Attribute	Simple English Meaning

name		Sets the database column name.
nullable	Decides whether the column can store NULL.
unique		Prevents duplicate values in that column.
length		Sets the maximum length of a string column.
precision	Sets the total number of digits in a decimal number.
scale		Sets the number of digits after the decimal point.
insertable	Decides whether the column is included in an SQL INSERT.
updatable	Decides whether the column is included in an SQL UPDATE.